            "notes": "For the first round, your priority is picking up the power called **Inner Peace**. This power is all about longevity: it grants you an orb that continuously helps you stay alive longer, especially when you\u2019re under pressure from flankers like Tracer, Genji, or Reaper.\n\nItems to Pick Up:\n\n**Armored Vest:** This is your main survivability piece. It\u2019s more effective than shields in this build because it helps you tank damage more reliably.\n\n**First Aid Kit:** This is your secondary survivability item to give you a bit of extra shield on top of the orb, ensuring you can outlast enemy dives.\n\nPlaystyle Tips:\nFor this first round, focus on playing Zenyatta conservatively. Stay in the backline and avoid being too aggressive. Your extra health and the constant healing from your orb will let you survive longer and keep your healing orb consistently on allies, especially your tank.\n\nIn summary, Round 1 is all about laying a sturdy foundation: prioritize staying alive, let your healing do its work, and save the aggression for later rounds.",
