            "notes": "In round two, you can be a TAD bit more aggressive.. You will have 440+HP\n\nFor power, pick up **Discord Fever** (tracers hate this) .. This will do damage to whoever you put the discord orb on, for 50dmg over 5sec. You will SHREAD through tanks or anyone that you put this on because they are constantly taking 10 dmg per sec, on top of you and/or your teammates shooting them.\n\nFor items, you're going to pick up the **Syphon Gloves** first. This item is all about giving you a bit of self-healing and a health boost whenever you land those quick kicks, which is super helpful if a Tracer or similar hero is jumping on you. \n\nThen you'll grab the **MEKA Z series** for an 8% boost to your health, armor, and shield, giving you a nice overall durability increase.\n\nNext, you'll want to pick up the **Crusader Hydraulics**, which adds another layer of armor and reduces the weapon damage you take while giving you a slight attack speed bonus. \n\nFinally, if you have enough resources, grab the **Keepsake of Chaos**. This will reward you with stacking armor whenever you eliminate enemies under your Discord Orb, up to 50 extra armor for the round.\n\nAlso some games I trade the MEKA z Series for Crusaders.. all up to you\n\nIn short, this round is all about layering up your survivability so you can stay alive and keep supporting your team even longer, and be a little more tanky if you want to fight.",
