            "notes": "For round three, the power we're picking up is ***~~~~Discord Inferno~~~~***. This synergizes perfectly with Discord Fever. Basically, when you critically hit a target that's under your Discord Orb, the orb will explode for 50 damage. Combined with the Fever effect, which deals 50 damage over 5 seconds, you can time it so that a critical hit at the end of those 5 seconds does another 50 damage, stacking up to 100 damage total.\n\nNow for the item adjustments: you'll go ahead and **sell **the **~~First Aid Kit~~** and the **~~Syphon Gloves~~** from earlier rounds. Instead, you'll pick up the **Ballistic Buffer **as a cheap option that gives you a bit of extra health and grants you some overhealth if you take damage from a distance. It's kind of a filler piece, so you can pick it up last if needed.\n\nThe main items you want to add are **Phantasmic Flux**, which will give you a nice boost to weapon power, ability power, and some lifesteal that can grant you overhealth when you're at full life. And then you'll pick up **Rustung Von Wilhelm**, which adds a hefty 15% to your health, armor, and shield, and gives you damage reduction when you're under 30% life, making you even tankier.\n\nEverything else from the previous rounds stays the same, so you're just upgrading into a more powerful, survivable build.",
