            "notes": "Welcome to the final round! If you've made it this far, you are now the Unkillable Lord Zenyatta. Here\u2019s how you\u2019ll seal the deal.\n\nFirst, you\u2019re going to pick up the power called **Instant Karma**. This is a game-changer: anyone who damages you while they have your Discord Orb on them will basically restore you for 30% of the damage they deal over two seconds. So they hit you, and you get some of that health back.\n\nNow, for your items, you're going to keep the Nebula Conduit from before, which gives you that nice 5% weapon power and 50 health, and it spreads out 15% of incoming damage over a few seconds. You\u2019ll keep the Ogundimu Reduction Field as well, adding 50 armor and stacking up that damage reduction each time you take a hit.\n\nYou\u2019re also going to hold onto the Phantasmic Flux, which boosts your weapon power, ability power, and gives you a bit of life steal on both weapons and abilities.\n\nThen you\u2019ll add the GloomGauntlet. This one gives you another 50 armor and a 15% boost to your melee damage, plus a bit of movement speed and healing whenever you land those snap kicks.\n\nYou\u2019ll keep the Rustung von Wilhelm for that extra health, armor, and shield, along with a damage reduction bonus when you\u2019re below 30% life. And finally, you can choose between keeping the MEKA Z series or swapping to the Crusader\u2019s item for a bit of extra weapon damage if you prefer.\n\nIn the end, this build is going to make you a true unkillable Zenyatta, ready to outlast and outplay pretty much anyone.",
